  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YOVENCO Youth Skills Training and Employment Promotion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will improve the living standard of 180 (100 female and 80 male) youth through provision of training, employment and business start up support. Skills providing to the different groups includes; carpentry, cooking and hospitality, construction works, Henna and Beautification and small business management.</narrative>
  </description>
